#. module: dally_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:dally_tracking.dally_shipment_event_action
msgid ""
"Events are created automatically when a shipment's status changes,\n"
"                and can also be added by hand. Only events marked\n"
"                <strong>visible to customer</strong> appear on the public tracking\n"
"                page."
msgstr ""
"Les événements sont créés automatiquement lors du changement de statut\n"
"                d’une expédition et peuvent aussi être ajoutés manuellement. Seuls les événements\n"
"                <strong>visibles par le client</strong> apparaissent sur la page publique de suivi."

#. module: dally_tracking
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:dally_tracking.dally_shipment_view_form_tracking
msgid ""
"Events are created automatically when the status changes.\n"
"                        Only those marked <strong>Customer</strong> appear on\n"
"                        <code>dallytrading.com/tracking</code>. Internal notes and\n"
"                        attached documents are never published."
msgstr ""
"Les événements sont créés automatiquement lors du changement de statut.\n"
"                        Seuls ceux marqués <strong>Client</strong> apparaissent sur\n"
"                        <code>dallytrading.com/tracking</code>. Les notes internes et\n"
"                        les documents joints ne sont jamais publiés."

#. module: dally_tracking
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:dally_tracking.field_dally_shipment_event__is_automatic
